      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This applies to emoji as well.\n\nRelated:\n\n- [［1514］ Photo Gallary should resize uploading images automatically](https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1514-photo-gallary-should-resize-uploading-images-automatically)\n\nI’ve created a userscript to work around this issue:\n\nhttps://misskey.io/notes/9zc669wcr0g40dwi",
